	quest.0168BDC29B566F51.quest_desc: [
		"&bSophisticated Storage&r introduces multiple tiers of Barrels, Chests, and Shulker Boxes, offering extensive customization and functionality. "
		""
		"&bBarrels&r and &bchests&r are available in &6all vanilla wood variants. "
		""
		"&6Storage blocks&r can also be &opersonalized&r by applying two colors, and barrels can be further customized by using materials from other blocks to change their appearance. "
		""
		"Additionally, a &bwide range of upgrades&r are available to enhance and expand their functionality. "
		""
		"The mod also includes &aLimited Barrels&r, designed for &6efficient mass storage&r. These barrels offer 1 to 4 slots for items, with increased stack size limits that grow even larger as the barrel's tier is upgraded. "
	]
	quest.0168BDC29B566F51.quest_subtitle: "Sophisticated Storage"
	quest.0168BDC29B566F51.title: "All Things: Barrels and Chests"
