		"Build a &eRotor&r from 12x Electromagnetic Coil, and a &eStator&r from 3x Magnet + 4x Electromagnetic Coil"
		""
		"Both are multiblock components of the Large Generator, a scale step past the base Generator"
		""
		"Every machine in this mod caps out around &e1000V&r before something breaks. If you're over 1000V, you have two fixes: drop a &eTransformer&r in line to step it down, or slow down the &eRPM&r feeding your Rotor or Generator directly"
