	quest.29C32B4D871B82F2.quest_desc: [
		"You've proven you're a trainer. You've proven you're an engineer. &eEverything from T0 to T4 built the case for both"
		""
		"&dThis chapter asks something different: are you a scientist?&r Understanding what a Pokémon actually is, where it comes from, what its limits are, and whether those limits can be broken at all"
		""
		"Expect hundreds of liquids. Genetic material. Machines built to analyze a Pokémon down to its components, its berries, its held items, &eeven Raiden Crystals&r. This is the tier where the factory stops building things and starts understanding them"
		""
		"&c&lThis chapter is a work in progress.&r Nothing beyond this quest exists yet. It's here so you know what's coming, not so you can start it"
		""
		"&aVersion 1.6 ends here. The rest of Genetic Mastery arrives in 2.0"
	]
	quest.29C32B4D871B82F2.quest_subtitle: "What Comes After Engineering"
	quest.29C32B4D871B82F2.title: "Genetic Mastery"
