	quest.2B4CD54377E19D14.quest_desc: [
		"I know we just gave you some Certus Quartz Crystal.  This was to grab your attention!"
		""
		"&bCertus Quartz Crystal&r is acquired from the &bCertus Budding Blocks&r.  The budding blocks behave like amethyst budding blocks.  "
		""
		"Certus grows from the sides of the Budding Blocks. If you break a fully grown cluster, it will drop four Certus Quartz Crystals, and fortune will increase this number."
		""
		"The &agrowing rate&r of budding blocks are quite &cslow&r. Early game certus production will be your limiting factor for AE2 progression"
		""
		"Luckily the &bGrowth Accelerator&r massively accelerates this process when placed adjacent to the budding block.  This will be a useful bit later as growth accelerator's need constant power"
	]
