	quest.2C84A1F620CEE547.quest_desc: [
		"Build a &eConverter&r and wire it between your T3-A Additions FE line and a fresh run of TFMG cable, using Cable Insulator"
		""
		"Set it to output mode, and scroll its &eVoltage Generation to 250&r. That's what the Polarizer coming up actually needs to run"
		""
		"The Converter only produces real Voltage and Current once something on the TFMG side is actually creating &eresistance&r, a genuine electrical load"
		""
		"&cAn empty network with nothing consuming power will always read 0V and 0A, no matter what you set the Voltage Generation to.&r Don't assume it's broken, it's waiting"
		""
		"The moment something downstream starts drawing power, that resistance appears, and the Converter starts producing for real"
	]
	quest.2C84A1F620CEE547.quest_subtitle: "Your First Real TFMG Power"
	quest.2C84A1F620CEE547.title: "Converter"
