		""
		"Have you been farming Raid Shards or have created a vast teleport network of wild Raid Den Crystals?  Well you're in luck.  The &6Cobblemon Paleontoligist&r have discovered that using certain gemstones on the Raid Crystals affect their 'Tier'"
