		"&6&nTier Two&r: &aGrass Gem&r or &#9A68FFPoison Gem"
		""
		"&6&nTier Three&r: &#D08770Rock Gem&r or &1Water Gem"
		""
		"&6&nTier Four&r: Normal Gem&r or &cFlying Gem"
		""
		"&6&nTier Five&r: &7Dark Gem&r or &#B48EADDragon Gem"
