	quest.7F50DE61ACB962BC.title: "Industrial Aesthetics and Kinetic Extras"
	quest.7F5490542E3C4DB2.quest_desc: [
		"&bChain Conveyors&r relay rotational power between each other.  You can connect two by right-clicking them with chains."
		""
		"&6Chain Conveyor&r can be crafted with:"
		"4x &bLarge Cogwheel"
		"1x &bAndesite Casing"
		""
		"&aPondering is recommended."
	]
	quest.7F5490542E3C4DB2.quest_subtitle: "Chain Zipline"
	quest.7F5E5CC661C124A7.quest_desc: [
		"Every Legendary and Mythical in the pack lives somewhere in this line, organized by generation"
		""
		"&aThe foundation is Legendary Monuments and Cobbleverse/Lumymon, but almost nothing here is a straight 1:1 copy of either mod"
		""
		"Structures got merged, items got swapped, trainers got new drops, entire mechanics got rebuilt from scratch"
		""
		"&cFollow these quests, don't go looking things up on the mods' own wikis. What you find there won't match what's actually in this pack half the time"
		""
		"Some Legendaries and Mythicals don't have a quest yet, no structure, no item chain, nothing built for them"
		""
		"&aIf you don't see one on this list, that's not an oversight, it means the Pokemon is a normal wild spawn for now"
	]
	quest.7F5E5CC661C124A7.quest_subtitle: "Welcome to one of the biggest catalog in the pack"
	quest.7F5E5CC661C124A7.title: "The Legends of Every Land"
